</ProtectedString></Properties></Item></Item><Item class="ModuleScript" referent="RBX6483A311264D4C5D902714184E6C5A10"><Properties><string name="Name">MotionTokens</string><ProtectedString name="Source">-- SKYBREAK: Fragments of the Core — Canonical Motion Tokens (Section 06)
